ctices_Ideal_Product_Forms" >5. 最佳存储实践 &amp; 理想的产品形态</a><ul class='ez-toc-list-level-3' ><li class='ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-7" href="#_Storage_Tips" > 存储技巧:</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-8" href="#Product_Types_Better_for_Long-Term_Storage" >更适合长期储存的产品类型:</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-9" href="#Bulk_Purchasing_Tip" >批量采购技巧:</a></li></ul></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-10" href="#6_FAQs" >6. 常见问题解答:</a><ul class='ez-toc-list-level-3' ><li class='ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-11" href="#Does_milk_thistle_expire" >水飞蓟会过期吗?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-12" href="#Do_milk_thistle_supplements_go_bad" >奶蓟补充剂会变质吗?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-13" href="#How_long_does_milk_thistle_last" >水飞蓟的保质期是多久?</a></li></ul></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-14" href="#7_Conclusion_What_Buyers_Need_to_Know" >7. 结论: 买家需要了解什么</a><ul class='ez-toc-list-level-3' ><li class='ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-15" href="#Explore_Bulk_Milk_Thistle_Products_%E2%86%92" >探索散装水飞蓟产品 →</a></li></ul></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-16" href="#References" >参考</a></li></ul></nav></div><h2 data-start="963" data-end="990"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="1_What_Is_Milk_Thistle"></span>1. 什么是水飞蓟?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="992" data-end="1232">水飞蓟是一种原产于地中海地区的开花植物，通常用作草药补充剂. 它的种子含有 <strong data-start="1122" data-end="1135">水飞蓟素</strong>, 一组具有抗氧化作用的黄酮木脂素, 消炎（药）, 和保肝特性.</p><p data-start="1234" data-end="1350">水飞蓟在传统医学中的应用已有多年 2,000 年, 主要针对肝胆疾病.</p><hr data-start="1352" data-end="1355" /><h2 data-start="1357" data-end="1397"><img src="/images/Does-Milk-Thistle-Expire-300x300.jpg" decoding="async" class="wp-image-1140 aligncenter" alt="Does Milk Thistle Expire" width="565" height="565" title="水飞蓟会过期吗? 水飞蓟能持续多久 &amp; 如何正确储存 4" /></h2><h2 data-start="1357" data-end="1397"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="2_What_Part_of_Milk_Thistle_Is_Used"></span>2. 使用水飞蓟的哪个部分?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="1399" data-end="1580">这 <strong data-start="1403" data-end="1434">种子 (也称为瘦果)</strong> 水飞蓟的主要部分用于药用. 有时, 整个水果或粉碎的种子粉末用于茶和胶囊中.</p><h3 data-start="1582" data-end="1599"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Common_forms"></span>常见形式:<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul data-start="1600" data-end="1727"><li data-start="1600" data-end="1632"><p data-start="1602" data-end="1632">全脂水飞蓟种子 (生的)</p></li><li data-start="1633" data-end="1653"><p data-start="1635" data-end="1653">磨碎的种子粉</p></li><li data-start="1654" data-end="1695"><p data-start="1656" data-end="1695">水飞蓟素提取物 (标准化 70–80%)</p></li><li data-start="1696" data-end="1727"><p data-start="1698" data-end="1727">油 (由种子冷压而成)</p></li></ul><hr data-start="1729" data-end="1732" /><h2 data-start="1734" data-end="1782"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="3_Nutritional_Analysis_of_Milk_Thistle_Parts"></span>3. 水飞蓟各部分的营养分析<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><div class="_tableContainer_16hzy_1"><div class="_tableWrapper_16hzy_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse" tabindex="-1"><table class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="2" data-start="1784" data-end="2460"><thead data-start="1784" data-end="1895"><tr data-start="1784" data-end="1895"><th data-start="1784" data-end="1809" data-col-size="sm">成分</th><th data-start="1809" data-end="1833" data-col-size="sm">整粒种子 (每100克)</th><th data-start="1833" data-end="1849" data-col-size="sm">磨粉</th><th data-start="1849" data-end="1875" data-col-size="sm">水飞蓟素提取物 (80%)</th><th data-start="1875" data-end="1895" data-col-size="sm">冷榨油</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="2009" data-end="2460"><tr data-start="2009" data-end="2121"><td data-start="2009" data-end="2034" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="2011" data-end="2024">水飞蓟素</strong></td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2034" data-end="2058">4–6%</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2058" data-end="2074">4–6%</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2074" data-end="2101">70–80%</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2101" data-end="2121">痕迹</td></tr><tr data-start="2122" data-end="2234"><td data-start="2122" data-end="2147" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="2124" data-end="2145">胖的 (主要是PUFA)</strong></td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2147" data-end="2171">25–30克</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2171" data-end="2187">25–30克</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2187" data-end="2214">&lt;1克</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2214" data-end="2234">～98克</td></tr><tr data-start="2235" data-end="2347"><td data-start="2235" data-end="2260" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="2237" data-end="2248">蛋白质</strong></td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2260" data-end="2284">18–20克</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2284" data-end="2300">18–20克</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2300" data-end="2327">&lt;1克</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2327" data-end="2347">0克</td></tr><tr data-start="2348" data-end="2460"><td data-start="2348" data-end="2373" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="2350" data-end="2373">保质期估计</strong></td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2373" data-end="2397">1–2 年</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2397" data-end="2413">12–18 个月</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2413" data-end="2440">2–3 年</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2440" data-end="2460">6–12 个月</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky end-(--thread-content-margin) h-0 self-end select-none"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end"></div></div></div></div><p data-start="2462" data-end="2475"><strong data-start="2462" data-end="2473">来源:</strong></p><ul data-start="2476" data-end="2630"><li data-start="2476" data-end="2517"><p data-start="2478" data-end="2517">欧洲药品管理局 (EMA, 2018)</p></li><li data-start="2518" data-end="2568"><p data-start="2520" data-end="2568">我们. 农业部 (美国农业部) 数据库</p></li><li data-start="2569" data-end="2630"><p data-start="2571" data-end="2630">美国国立卫生研究院 (NIH) 草药补充剂的事实</p></li></ul><hr data-start="2632" data-end="2635" /><h2 data-start="2637" data-end="2683"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="4_What_Happens_When_Milk_Thistle_Goes_Bad"></span>4. 当水飞蓟变质时会发生什么?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="2685" data-end="2781">过期或保存不当时, 水飞蓟可能会失去效力或产生有害的副产品:</p><ul data-start="2783" data-end="3158"><li data-start="2783" data-end="2895"><p data-start="2785" data-end="2895"><strong data-start="2785" data-end="2810">水飞蓟素降解</strong>: 抗氧化活性降低 (来源: 药学与药理学杂志, 2014)</p></li><li data-start="2896" data-end="2999"><p data-start="2898" data-end="2999"><strong data-start="2898" data-end="2913">酸败的油</strong>: 冷榨油会氧化, 成型 <strong data-start="2950" data-end="2975">醛和酮</strong>, 哪些具有细胞毒性.</p></li><li data-start="3000" data-end="3158"><p data-start="3002" data-end="3158"><strong data-start="3002" data-end="3020">霉菌毒素风险</strong>: 暴露在潮湿的环境中可能会导致霉菌生长, 尤其 <strong data-start="3076" data-end="3098">黄曲霉</strong>, 可以产生 <strong data-start="3118" data-end="3132">黄曲霉毒素</strong>, 已知的肝癌致癌物.</p></li></ul><blockquote data-start="3160" data-end="3340"><p data-start="3162" data-end="3340">💡 根据 2021 学习于 <em data-start="3194" data-end="3208">食品控制</em>, 储存不当的水飞蓟种子表现出 3.4% 潮湿条件下可检出黄曲霉毒素的污染率 65% 相对湿度.</p></blockquote><hr data-start="3342" data-end="3345" /><h2 data-start="3347" data-end="3397"><img src="/images/Does-Milk-Thistle-Expire-2-300x300.jpg" decoding="async" class="wp-image-1141 aligncenter" alt="Does Milk Thistle Expire" width="575" height="575" title="水飞蓟会过期吗? 水飞蓟能持续多久 &amp; 如何正确储存 5" /></h2><h2 data-start="3347" data-end="3397"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="5_Best_Storage_Practices_Ideal_Product_Forms"></span>5. 最佳存储实践 &amp; 理想的产品形态<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><h3 data-start="3399" data-end="3418"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="_Storage_Tips"></span> 存储技巧:<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul data-start="3419" data-end="3532"><li data-start="3419" data-end="3453"><p data-start="3421" data-end="3453">储存于 <strong data-start="3430" data-end="3453">密封容器</strong></p></li><li data-start="3454" data-end="3500"><p data-start="3456" data-end="3500">保存在一个 <strong data-start="3466" data-end="3500">凉爽的, 干燥的地方 (&lt;25°C / 77°F)</strong></p></li><li data-start="3501" data-end="3532"><p data-start="3503" data-end="3532">避免 <strong data-start="3509" data-end="3532">阳光 &amp; 湿度</strong></p></li></ul><h3 data-start="3534" data-end="3584"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Product_Types_Better_for_Long-Term_Storage"></span>更适合长期储存的产品类型:<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><div class="_tableContainer_16hzy_1"><div class="_tableWrapper_16hzy_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse" tabindex="-1"><table class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="2" data-start="3586" data-end="4135"><thead data-start="3586" data-end="3675"><tr data-start="3586" data-end="3675"><th data-start="3586" data-end="3608" data-col-size="sm">产品类型</th><th data-start="3608" data-end="3621" data-col-size="sm">保质期</th><th data-start="3621" data-end="3647" data-col-size="sm">最佳包装</th><th data-start="3647" data-end="3675" data-col-size="sm">批量成本效益</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="3768" data-end="4135"><tr data-start="3768" data-end="3859"><td data-start="3768" data-end="3790" data-col-size="sm">整粒种子</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="3790" data-end="3803">18–24 个月</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="3803" data-end="3830">真空密封PE袋</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="3830" data-end="3859">★★★★★</td></tr><tr data-start="3860" data-end="3951"><td data-start="3860" data-end="3882" data-col-size="sm">水飞蓟素提取物</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="3882" data-end="3895">24–36 个月</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="3895" data-end="3922">铝箔袋</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="3922" data-end="3951">★★★★☆</td></tr><tr data-start="3952" data-end="4043"><td data-start="3952" data-end="3974" data-col-size="sm">磨粉</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="3974" data-end="3987">12–18个月</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="3987" data-end="4014">密封 HDPE 容器</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="4014" data-end="4043">★★★☆☆</td></tr><tr data-start="4044" data-end="4135"><td data-start="4044" data-end="4066" data-col-size="sm">冷榨油</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="4066" data-end="4079">6–12 个月</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="4079" data-end="4106">琥珀色玻璃瓶</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="4106" data-end="4135">★★☆☆☆</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky end-(--thread-content-margin) h-0 self-end select-none"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end"></div></div></div></div><h3 data-start="4137" data-end="4161"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Bulk_Purchasing_Tip"></span>批量采购技巧:<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><blockquote data-start="4162" data-end="4323"><p data-start="4164" data-end="4323">选择 <strong data-start="4171" data-end="4186">整个种子</strong> 或者 <strong data-start="4190" data-end="4225">标准化水飞蓟素提取物</strong> 和 <strong data-start="4231" data-end="4238">COA</strong> 和 <strong data-start="4243" data-end="4259">水分 &lt;8%</strong>, 真空密封在铝或 PE 内袋中，外加纸箱.</p></blockquote><hr data-start="4325" data-end="4328" /><h2 data-start="4330" data-end="4373"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="6_FAQs"></span>6. 常见问题解答:<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><h3 data-start="4375" data-end="4408"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Does_milk_thistle_expire"></span><strong data-start="4379" data-end="4408">水飞蓟会过期吗?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="4409" data-end="4544">是的, 奶蓟草像所有天然产品一样会过期. 取决于形式和存储, 其保质期范围为 <strong data-start="4520" data-end="4543">6 几个月到 3 年</strong>.</p><h3 data-start="4546" data-end="4589"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Do_milk_thistle_supplements_go_bad"></span><strong data-start="4550" data-end="4589">奶蓟补充剂会变质吗?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="4590" data-end="4754">是的. 过期的水飞蓟补充剂可能会失去效力，并可能变质或被霉菌污染. 经常检查 <strong data-start="4709" data-end="4725">有效期</strong> 和 <strong data-start="4730" data-end="4753">包装完整性</strong>.</p><h3 data-start="4756" data-end="4796"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="How_long_does_milk_thistle_last"></span><strong data-start="4760" data-end="4796">水飞蓟的保质期是多久?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul data-start="4797" data-end="4903"><li data-start="4797" data-end="4828"><p data-start="4799" data-end="4828">整粒种子: 最多 24 月</p></li><li data-start="4829" data-end="4857"><p data-start="4831" data-end="4857">提炼: 最多 36 月</p></li><li data-start="4858" data-end="4882"><p data-start="4860" data-end="4882">粉末: 12–18 个月</p></li><li data-start="4883" data-end="4903"><p data-start="4885" data-end="4903">油: 6–12 个月</p></li></ul><hr data-start="4905" data-end="4908" /><h2 data-start="4910" data-end="4952"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="7_Conclusion_What_Buyers_Need_to_Know"></span>7. 结论: 买家需要了解什么<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="4954" data-end="5258">基于 EMA 的验证数据和研究, 美国农业部, 和同行评审期刊, <strong data-start="5038" data-end="5118">水飞蓟的保质期在很大程度上取决于其形状和储存条件</strong>. 寻求最长保质期和质量保证的大宗买家应优先考虑 <strong data-start="5203" data-end="5257">标准化提取物或真空包装的整粒种子</strong>.</p><p data-start="5260" data-end="5375">如果您正在采购 <strong data-start="5279" data-end="5330">水飞蓟种子, 粉末, 或批量提取</strong>, 访问我们的 <a class="" href="#" rel="noopener" data-start="5342" data-end="5363"><strong data-start="5343" data-end="5359">产品页面</strong></a> 探索:</p><ul data-start="5377" data-end="5529"><li data-start="5377" data-end="5409"><p data-start="5379" data-end="5409">完整的COA + 3研发方测试</p></li><li data-start="5410" data-end="5445"><p data-start="5412" data-end="5445">出口定制包装</p></li><li data-start="5446" data-end="5479"><p data-start="5448" data-end="5479">有竞争力的批发价格</p></li><li data-start="5480" data-end="5529"><p data-start="5482" data-end="5529">来自认证生产基地的全球交付</p></li></ul><hr data-start="5531" data-end="5534" /><h3 data-start="5536" data-end="5584"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Explore_Bulk_Milk_Thistle_Products_%E2%86%92"></span><a href="/zh/milk-thistle-seed-bulk-north-china-production/">探索散装水飞蓟产品 →</a><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><hr data-start="5586" data-end="5589" /><h2 data-start="5591" data-end="5607"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="References"></span>参考<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><ol data-start="5609" data-end="6013"><li data-start="5609" data-end="5716"><p data-start="5612" data-end="5716">EMA. (2018). <em data-start="5625" data-end="5686">水飞蓟评估报告 (L。) 盖尔滕。, 水果</em>. 欧洲药品管理局.</p></li><li data-start="5717" data-end="5791"><p data-start="5720" data-end="5791">美国国立卫生研究院膳食补充剂办公室. (2022). <em data-start="5763" data-end="5788">水飞蓟情况说明书</em>.</p></li><li data-start="5792" data-end="5887"><p data-start="5795" data-end="5887">药学与药理学杂志 (2014). &#8220;草药制剂中水飞蓟素的稳定性&#8221;.</p></li><li data-start="5888" data-end="5915"><p data-start="5891" data-end="5915">美国农业部食品数据中心.</p></li><li data-start="5916" data-end="6013"><p data-start="5919" data-end="6013"><em data-start="5919" data-end="5933">食品控制</em>, 体积 123, 2021: “储存的水飞蓟种子存在黄曲霉毒素污染风险。”</p></li></ol>`} />
